{"title":"1972 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964c4da14c0bb01fd191d07a567e6f12eafe97c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1/2}, 3^{1/3}, 8^{1/8}, 9^{1/9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"19\" /> those which have the greatest and the next to the greatest values, in that order, are \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/080a4526f79b75c419a6be9401d365a468bf4aad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3^{1/3},\\ 2^{1/2}\\quad  \\textbf{(B) } 3^{1/3},\\ 8^{1/8}\\quad  \\textbf{(C) } 3^{1/3},\\ 9^{1/9}\\quad  \\textbf{(D) } 8^{1/8},\\ 9^{1/9}\\quad \\\\  \\text{(E) None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e515d73961f8474615911db41a4beedc5df17c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{1/8}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/1/c71b609d28cb17f1e7a58608abea580fecb2964b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9^{1/9}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> are obviously too small. We must then compare <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e2ca2ee4e88cba256609980cd01550da5f6e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1/3}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/a/73a13e564e9ae8acf3cf0095847a9b10d9944a5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1/2}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />. Raising both to the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. Our answer is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de01ad32a60f0bac146a67ec6734808f5136e8f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 3^{1/3},\\ 2^{1/2}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"124\" height=\"32\" /> ~lopkiloinm\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017131039\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1876/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19980:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017131039 and revision id 136869. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}